cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Subnational Spatial Epidemiology of HIV Prevalence and Socioeconomic Determinants in Ghana: 260-District Analysis"
abstract: >
 Reproducible analysis pipeline for a spatial epidemiological study of HIV
 prevalence and its socioeconomic determinants across Ghana's 260 administrative
 districts. Methods include Global Moran's I, Bivariate LISA, Getis-Ord Gi*,
 spatial lag regression, LASSO, and Random Forest with SHAP interpretability.
 Top predictor: VCT uptake (|SHAP|=0.639); Moran's I=0.907 (p<0.001).
